# Resume playback position: prevent post-start seek(0) in MusicService (mod33).
#
# When Audio Start (0x03081432) runs, 0x03080d54 restores the saved ElapsedMS
# and seeks the audio decoder. However, stock callers immediately follow Audio Start
# with an unconditional seek(0) (bl 0x030834d8 with r0=0, r1=0), which wiped
# the position back to 00:00. NOP out the three unconditional seek(0) calls.
33:030817f8:00bf00bf00bf00bf
33:03081858:00bf00bf00bf00bf
33:030819a4:00bf00bf00bf00bf
